  "instructions": [
    "Prepare tapioca pearls by soaking them in water for 30 minutes. Boil with salt until soft.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix flour and melted butter; add milk and eggs to make batter.",
    "Pour half the batter into prepared pan and top with half the cooked bacon and herbs (optional).",
    "Cook pancakes on medium heat until golden brown, flipping once.",
    "Repeat process with remaining batter. Serve hot with additional crispy bacon slices."
